WarningNotification:
	'''
	Hey there, here's a bit you should know before playing our mod, Resonant Souls!
	This mod ONLY adds compatibility with Fargo's. Any compatibility between mods that this mod supports will not be added. Don't ask.
	If there is a bug, balancing issue, or anything of the sort related to two mods, DO NOT report it in the discord server.
	For example: If Redemption and Spirit have an incompatibility, this mod will NOT fix it, that's up to the main devs.
	Again, DO NOT go to the Resonant Souls Discord if there are any issues unless Resonant Souls is the mod that causes the problem
	You can check to see if it is by disabling Resonant Souls to see if the issue occurs
	However, this mod will fix issues with Fargo's Souls and the mods this mod supports
	For instance, if Redemption and Fargo's Souls have an incompatibility, this mod will fix that.
	After you have acknowledged this, there is a config you can turn off so you don't get this message anymore.
	'''
